<title>USA: FGIC qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies two muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following two municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Southington, Conn., $5.35 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Trenton, N.J., $5.06 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
